# Multi-Tier Data Lake

This directory houses all data assets partitioned into four strict logical tiers based on their processing maturity.

## Storage Tiers

- **`1_raw_data/` (Bronze Tier)**: Temporary landing zone for heavy binary files (e.g., source PDFs). Content here is highly volatile and subject to automated purges once its extraction has been validated.
- **`2_register_data/` (Silver Tier)**: Central immutable ledger tracking global system states (`_registry.csv`).
  - **CRITICAL RULE**: This folder and its contents **CANNOT** be deleted or manually altered. It acts as the single source of truth for deduplication and pipeline state.
- **`3_exploitable_data/` (Gold Tier)**: Normalized, structured, and ultra-light text assets (Markdown) optimized for direct agent exploitation.
  - **CRITICAL RULE**: This folder is permanent and must never be purged. Unlike `1_raw_data`, it is not regenerable without re-running extraction, and it is the reusable knowledge base the rest of the pipeline exists to build.
- **`4_vector_data/` (Platinum Tier)**: Section-aware, metadata-rich chunks (JSON) derived from the Gold tier, ready to be embedded into any vector store. No specific database is assumed — this tier stays store-agnostic by design.